    "detailed_description": "<h1>Community and Playtest</h1><p><br>Join our Discord to chat with the developers, or participate in the Steam discussions. <br>Your feedback is very important to us!</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>&quot;Timeless Heart VR is a narrative-focused VR roguelite action game. In it, you'll encounter the fates of various realms sealed within the cage of time and space, while discovering the essence and meaning of this space. As the second entry in the Timeless Stories series, this game further simplifies and enriches the unique sword technique system of the series. It introduces a distinctive VR gameplay mode that merges first-person and third-person perspectives for cooperative play. You will control both yourself and your companion Lycanea, exploring and advancing through four stylistically distinct realms. Choose your weapons and your companion's armor wisely, and together break through the blockades set by fate!&quot;<br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game system introduction:</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sword Skill System: </strong></li></ul>Players will get &quot;Chain Claw Prosthetic Arm&quot; to assist in melee / range attack action.<br>At the same time in the game players will randomly obtain a variety of special style weapons to further strengthen their own ability.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/b6f59ff5fa54f7646eae0bd8ec301ab7.poster.avif?t=1749625096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/b6f59ff5fa54f7646eae0bd8ec301ab7.webm?t=1749625096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/b6f59ff5fa54f7646eae0bd8ec301ab7.mp4?t=1749625096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Chain Claw System: </strong></li></ul>Players can use the chain claw to rapidly evade attacks from enemies and grab special objects in the scene to throw/use to break the enemy's weaknesses.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/2534c63dfcc6096f8a88682101b29a0b.poster.avif?t=1749625096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/2534c63dfcc6096f8a88682101b29a0b.webm?t=1749625096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/2534c63dfcc6096f8a88682101b29a0b.mp4?t=1749625096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Companion Assistance System: </strong></li></ul>Lycaena, the heroine of this game, will accompany the player in battle, and she will also gain new skills and armor as the game progresses.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/6f94afc971a7259b60224ee2a288a937.poster.avif?t=1749625096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/6f94afc971a7259b60224ee2a288a937.webm?t=1749625096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/6f94afc971a7259b60224ee2a288a937.mp4?t=1749625096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Elemental reaction system: </strong></li></ul>This game introduces four major elemental attributes: wind, ice, flame, and thunder. Each of them will correspond to different special effects, and different elements will react with each other to produce additional cumulative effects. Building your own and your teammates' elemental attributes properly can help you defeat your enemies more efficiently.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/30b8fea62ecf8916d495ba14f26d675b.avif?t=1749625096\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Story:</strong></li></ul><i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/2384949214132e7a0360856b5ea3f9cd.avif?t=1749625096\" /></div><br>&quot;Let me guess... You're at a point where you don't remember me, right?&quot;<br>&quot;The time here is chaotic, maybe we've already met at some point in the future.&quot; <br>&quot;Or perhaps we've already had some interaction in the past?&quot; <br>&quot;Welcome to the cage of time and space, lost traveler.&quot; <br>&quot;Let's get along as fellow prisoners.&quot; <br>\u2014\u2014Lycaena<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/27d34974423b77efd7c38bf77438ace8.avif?t=1749625096\" /></div><br>&quot;I am Amadeus, the guardian of this space. &quot;<br>&quot;I advise you to halt here. Cease from further destabilizing this realm.&quot;<br>&quot;But alas, it has come to this point, and I suppose you won't heed my words.&quot;<br>\u2014\u2014Amadeus<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/fc224b64fc6de4db22eccc28ff90008f.avif?t=1749625096\" /></div>\u2003<br>&quot;I have been waiting for a long time, My Lord. Have you finally responded to me?&quot;<br>&quot;Ah, I see... Weren't you the deities guarding this land?&quot;<br>&quot;It seems my prayers were not devout enough.&quot;<br>\u2014\u2014Aurora<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/7568d155ae9e7ff45eb5315ee86dc92f.avif?t=1749625096\" /></div><br>&quot;Hello, lost traveler, and this beautiful lady.&quot;<br>&quot;I am Cyrus, the captain of the Imperial Knight Order. It seems like I've lost an important memory.&quot;<br>\u2014\u2014Cyrus</i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/1d1747c2d0c01b09e42d3df483698017.avif?t=1749625096\" /></div><br><i>&quot;Please remember this no matter what.&quot;<br>\u201cThis is by no means a journey of despair.\u201c<br>\u201cThe wills you encounter will be with you.\u201d<br>\u201cToward the tomorrow you hope for.\u201d<br>\u201cTo Recreate this 'World'.\u201d</i>",
    "about_the_game": "&quot;Timeless Heart VR is a narrative-focused VR roguelite action game. In it, you'll encounter the fates of various realms sealed within the cage of time and space, while discovering the essence and meaning of this space. As the second entry in the Timeless Stories series, this game further simplifies and enriches the unique sword technique system of the series. It introduces a distinctive VR gameplay mode that merges first-person and third-person perspectives for cooperative play. You will control both yourself and your companion Lycanea, exploring and advancing through four stylistically distinct realms. Choose your weapons and your companion's armor wisely, and together break through the blockades set by fate!&quot;<br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game system introduction:</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sword Skill System: </strong></li></ul>Players will get &quot;Chain Claw Prosthetic Arm&quot; to assist in melee / range attack action.<br>At the same time in the game players will randomly obtain a variety of special style weapons to further strengthen their own ability.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/b6f59ff5fa54f7646eae0bd8ec301ab7.poster.avif?t=1749625096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/b6f59ff5fa54f7646eae0bd8ec301ab7.webm?t=1749625096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/b6f59ff5fa54f7646eae0bd8ec301ab7.mp4?t=1749625096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Chain Claw System: </strong></li></ul>Players can use the chain claw to rapidly evade attacks from enemies and grab special objects in the scene to throw/use to break the enemy's weaknesses.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/2534c63dfcc6096f8a88682101b29a0b.poster.avif?t=1749625096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/2534c63dfcc6096f8a88682101b29a0b.webm?t=1749625096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/2534c63dfcc6096f8a88682101b29a0b.mp4?t=1749625096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Companion Assistance System: </strong></li></ul>Lycaena, the heroine of this game, will accompany the player in battle, and she will also gain new skills and armor as the game progresses.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/6f94afc971a7259b60224ee2a288a937.poster.avif?t=1749625096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/6f94afc971a7259b60224ee2a288a937.webm?t=1749625096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/6f94afc971a7259b60224ee2a288a937.mp4?t=1749625096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Elemental reaction system: </strong></li></ul>This game introduces four major elemental attributes: wind, ice, flame, and thunder. Each of them will correspond to different special effects, and different elements will react with each other to produce additional cumulative effects. Building your own and your teammates' elemental attributes properly can help you defeat your enemies more efficiently.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/30b8fea62ecf8916d495ba14f26d675b.avif?t=1749625096\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Story:</strong></li></ul><i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/2384949214132e7a0360856b5ea3f9cd.avif?t=1749625096\" /></div><br>&quot;Let me guess... You're at a point where you don't remember me, right?&quot;<br>&quot;The time here is chaotic, maybe we've already met at some point in the future.&quot; <br>&quot;Or perhaps we've already had some interaction in the past?&quot; <br>&quot;Welcome to the cage of time and space, lost traveler.&quot; <br>&quot;Let's get along as fellow prisoners.&quot; <br>\u2014\u2014Lycaena<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/27d34974423b77efd7c38bf77438ace8.avif?t=1749625096\" /></div><br>&quot;I am Amadeus, the guardian of this space. &quot;<br>&quot;I advise you to halt here. Cease from further destabilizing this realm.&quot;<br>&quot;But alas, it has come to this point, and I suppose you won't heed my words.&quot;<br>\u2014\u2014Amadeus<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/fc224b64fc6de4db22eccc28ff90008f.avif?t=1749625096\" /></div>\u2003<br>&quot;I have been waiting for a long time, My Lord. Have you finally responded to me?&quot;<br>&quot;Ah, I see... Weren't you the deities guarding this land?&quot;<br>&quot;It seems my prayers were not devout enough.&quot;<br>\u2014\u2014Aurora<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/7568d155ae9e7ff45eb5315ee86dc92f.avif?t=1749625096\" /></div><br>&quot;Hello, lost traveler, and this beautiful lady.&quot;<br>&quot;I am Cyrus, the captain of the Imperial Knight Order. It seems like I've lost an important memory.&quot;<br>\u2014\u2014Cyrus</i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/1d1747c2d0c01b09e42d3df483698017.avif?t=1749625096\" /></div><br><i>&quot;Please remember this no matter what.&quot;<br>\u201cThis is by no means a journey of despair.\u201c<br>\u201cThe wills you encounter will be with you.\u201d<br>\u201cToward the tomorrow you hope for.\u201d<br>\u201cTo Recreate this 'World'.\u201d</i>",
